ret add p 4
end
end
if ge r 5
if lit4 js p 102 97 108 115
if eq get js add p 4 101
ret add p 5
end
end
end
ret 0
end

note parser state st: 0 offset, 1 depth, 2 next step (0 value, 1 member, 2 after a value),
note 8+d container kind at depth d (1 object), 16+d content offset of that object's first key
fn jnum js view uchar 4194304 n ulong wk edit ulong 65536 st edit ulong 32 p ulong to long
